# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository, regardless of a
# contributor's local core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Windows clients
# with core.autocrlf=true check text files out as CRLF, which prettier/
# eslint then flag on every line — exactly what happened after merging
# architecture-cleanup into main (685 files, ~63k lint errors, purely from
# line endings, zero real content difference).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
